post.x-mcp-description:
Upsert one project. Omit id to create; send id to update an existing project.
Example create: {"name":"team-demo"}
Example update: {"id":"<projectId>","name":"team-demo-renamed"}
Requires admin. Every project maps to a Kubernetes namespace; saveProject only stores metadata, deployApp or deployAgent creates the namespace.

Run a shell command in the first running Pod of this app. Requires write access to the app.
Example: {"command":"ls -la /app","cwd":"/app","timeoutSec":120}
Returns stdout, stderr and exitCode. The command is executed inside the live Pod and can modify application data.
